# Abandoned GGML_CPU_ALL_VARIANTS experiment (vendored+patched whisper-rs-sys copy,
# kept out of git — see docs/session-history and docs/ROADMAP.local.md's "C shim loader"
# entry for the superseding approach). Not referenced by Cargo.toml (patch commented out).
