# VoxBridge (docs/ROADMAP.local.md's "C shim loader" entry) now lives in its own repo,
# github.com/tednv/VoxBridge, pulled in here as a git submodule (see .gitmodules) and as
# a git dependency in src-tauri/Cargo.toml — nothing under voxbridge/ is tracked directly
# by this repo anymore.
# Built engine variant DLLs/SOs (voxbridge/scripts/build-engines.mjs output, staged here via
# --out-dir by scripts/tauri-runner.mjs) - generated at build time, picked up by
# tauri.conf.json's bundle.resources; not source, not committed.
src-tauri/engines-dist/
